   "html": "<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">int find(int x){</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  if(fa[x] != x) fa[x] = ① ;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  return fa[x];</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">4</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">}</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>    <div class=\"box base\"><div class=\"box-title\"><span class=\"ic\">基</span>样例</div><p>输入：fa=[0,0,1,2]（0 为根）｜ find(3) 返回 <b>0</b>，且路径被压缩。</p></div>    <div class=\"quiz\" data-qid=\"ft4\" data-type=\"fill\" data-correct=\"[&quot;find(fa[x])&quot;,&quot;fa[x]&quot;,&quot;x&quot;,&quot;fa[fa[x]]&quot;]\" data-module=\"paper\"><div class=\"q-q\">① 处应填入？ <span class=\"q-type\">填空题</span> <span class=\"q-diff q-diff-3\">难</span></div><div class=\"q-opts\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"q-fill\" placeholder=\"输入答案（如 8 / 八）\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div class=\"q-bar\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn q-submit\">提交答案</button><span class=\"q-fb\"></span></div><div class=\"q-explain\" hidden><div class=\"q-explain-hd\">✅ 正确答案：<b>find(fa[x])</b></div><div class=\"q-explain-bd\">递归找根并压缩路径，把整条链挂到根。</div><div class=\"q-wrong\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn ghost q-towrong\">📕 加入错题本</button></div></div></div>",
   "text": "C++ 复制 1 int find(int x){ 2 if(fa[x] != x) fa[x] = ① ; 3 return fa[x]; 4 } 基 样例 输入：fa=[0,0,1,2]（0 为根）｜ find(3) 返回 0 ，且路径被压缩。 ① 处应填入？ 填空题 难 提交答案 ✅ 正确答案： find(fa[x]) 递归找根并压缩路径，把整条链挂到根。 📕 加入错题本"
