  {
   "id": "f6",
   "title": "完善程序（六）· 贪心选区间",
   "html": "<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">sort(a,a+n,[](Seg x,Seg y){return x.r&lt;y.r;});</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">int last=-1, ans=0;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">for(int i=0;i&lt;n;i++)</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">4</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  if(a[i].l &gt;= last){ ans++; ① ; }</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>    <div class=\"box base\"><div class=\"box-title\"><span class=\"ic\">基</span>样例</div><p>输入：区间 [1,3],[2,5],[4,6] ｜ 最多选 2 个不重叠区间。</p></div>    <div class=\"quiz\" data-qid=\"ft6\" data-type=\"fill\" data-correct=\"[&quot;last=a[i].r&quot;,&quot;last=a[i].l&quot;,&quot;ans++&quot;,&quot;i++&quot;]\" data-module=\"paper\"><div class=\"q-q\">① 处应填入？ <span class=\"q-type\">填空题</span> <span class=\"q-diff q-diff-3\">难</span></div><div class=\"q-opts\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"q-fill\" placeholder=\"输入答案（如 8 / 八）\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div class=\"q-bar\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn q-submit\">提交答案</button><span class=\"q-fb\"></span></div><div class=\"q-explain\" hidden><div class=\"q-explain-hd\">✅ 正确答案：<b>last=a[i].r</b></div><div class=\"q-explain-bd\">选当前区间后更新已选最右端，保证后续能接上；样例验证得 2。</div><div class=\"q-wrong\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn ghost q-towrong\">📕 加入错题本</button></div></div></div>    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"ftReport\"></div>\n  </div>\n    <div class=\"side-col\">\n    <div class=\"side-toc\" id=\"toc\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wrap self-quiz\">",
   "text": "C++ 复制 1 sort(a,a+n,[](Seg x,Seg y){return x.r<y.r;}); 2 int last=-1, ans=0; 3 for(int i=0;i<n;i++) 4 if(a[i].l >= last){ ans++; ① ; } 基 样例 输入：区间 [1,3],[2,5],[4,6] ｜ 最多选 2 个不重叠区间。 ① 处应填入？ 填空题 难 提交答案 ✅ 正确答案： last=a[i].r 选当前区间后更新已选最右端，保证后续能接上；样例验证得 2。 📕 加入错题本"
